{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110309","id":2806207433,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6nQ1PJ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110309","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110309.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110309.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110309","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110309/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110309/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110309/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3c3c13e8decebe64a1dce927814179037a316365","number":110309,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Import: Implement Vulkan Video for Matroska/H.264 Decoding","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12864.\r\n\r\nIn technical terms, *decoding* of Matroska and H.264 streams is mostly handled. There's still several missing fields (and decoding more than one matroska cluster at a time) but the majority of relevant fields are parsed.\r\n\r\nConnecting the matroska/H.264 metadata to Vulkan is still very much a work in progress. Ideally by separating Matroska from the particular encoding it uses we can reuse H.264 streams for any other container format  and allow containers to be mostly unconcerned of their internal encoding.\r\n\r\nThis PR is primarily about Vulkan Video, matroska is merely one open container format which can include H.264 streams and is therefore useful for testing. Playing matroska audio is not yet supported.\r\n\r\n@fire the first commit is more stable (we can actually reach `vkCmdDecodeVideoKHR` before segfaulting at that point). The second commit  is more broken because I tried to reduce the amount of hardcoding done inside the vulkan device driver but didn't properly connect things in RenderingDevice yet.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","i